---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const crumbs = [
  { name: "Home", url: "/" },
  { name: "About", url: "/about" },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="What Deli Daily Updates World is about — our editorial standards, what we cover, and who it's for."
>
  <PageLayout title="About this site" breadcrumbs={crumbs}>
    <p>
      <strong>Deli Daily Updates World</strong> is an evergreen information and blogging platform.
      We publish practical guides, clear tutorials, troubleshooting fixes, useful tips, and honest
      buying advice for the everyday technology problems people actually run into.
    </p>

    <h2>What we're not</h2>
    <p>
      We are not a breaking-news site and we do not chase headlines. Our articles are written to
      stay useful for months and years, not hours. Instead of hundreds of rushed posts, we focus
      on fewer, genuinely helpful ones that we keep up to date.
    </p>

    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <p>
      Our topics include technology, AI, Android and iPhone, Windows and Mac, laptops and
      computers, apps and software, the internet, gadgets, how-to guides, tutorials,
      troubleshooting, tips and tricks, life hacks, productivity, online tools, cybersecurity
      awareness, blogging and SEO, and buying guides. New topics are added as readers need them.
    </p>

    <h2>Our editorial standards</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Clear and correct:</strong> instructions are step-by-step and tested wherever possible.</li>
      <li><strong>Honest:</strong> affiliate links and sponsored content are always disclosed.</li>
      <li><strong>Accessible:</strong> articles are written in plain language, without unnecessary jargon.</li>
      <li><strong>Up to date:</strong> we review and update evergreen articles so they stay accurate.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>AI-assisted drafting</h2>
    <p>
      We use AI to help draft and research articles. Every article is reviewed, fact-checked, and
      edited by a human before it is published. We never publish AI output automatically.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, or collaboration ideas? See our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>
      or read the <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a>, <a href="/terms">terms of use</a>,
      and <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a>.
    </p>
  </PageLayout>
</BaseLayout>
